    note = "CORE ARGUMENT: Offers a realist reading of Marx centred on the Grundrisse notebooks as an alternative to interpretations rooted in the 1859 Preface. MARX-CENTRALITY: Title: 'Marx's model of capital'; primary texts (Grundrisse) are the main subject.",
