    note = "CORE ARGUMENT: Uses an accounting interpretation of Marx's theories of history and value to defend the prediction that capitalism leads to socialism. MARX-CENTRALITY: Title: history in Marx's Capital. YEAR NOTE: CrossRef gives 2019; S2 lists 2020 (CrossRef preferred).",
